  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of current, it seems the \"untrusted URLs\" function is not working as intended when playing on Windows 11 installs, regardless of whether it is public release or beta branch. Things such as Youtube videos play fine however any untrusted URLs, such as those found in movie worlds, do not play and feed an error to the console. This is what leads me to believe it may specifically have to do with the \"untrusted URLs\" option as apposed to being an issue with video players in general. Obviously the current playerbase that may be on Windows 11 is most likely incredibly small, but it may be worth looking into as more people begin to migrate forward.",
